    *PMID:*: 41952073
    *Study Design:*: Systematic review and meta-analysis
    *Sample Size:*: 19 studies, 8268 POTS patients
    *Key Findings:*:
        - 36.3% (95% CI 17.8-60.0) of POTS patients report comorbid mast cell activation syndrome (MCAS)
