=== Abbotts et al.\ 2025 — Histamine-Receptor Blockade and Exercise (Null)

    *Full Citation:*: Abbotts KSS, Hudgins JH, Viveros IS, et al.\ Histamine-receptor blockade does not influence the heavy-severe domain boundary and time to task failure in the severe domain during cycling exercise in adults. _Physiological Reports_. 2025;13(19):e70587.
